              Award (COSC2083 Introduction to IT)
            </strong>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="award">
          <span class="award__year">2020</span>
          <div>
            <strong class="award__title">
              2020 School of Science &amp; Technology Recognition for Achievements in
              Research
            </strong>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="award">
          <span class="award__year">2019</span>
          <div>
            <strong class="award__title">
              2019 School of Science &amp; Technology Recognition for Achievement in
              Learning and Teaching Activities (Semester 2019-B)
            </strong>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="award">
